    "text": "1 days ago LOUISA — Alan Short is the all-time winningest head coach in the tradition-rich Lawrence County football program’s history. Short became Lawrence County’s winningest head coach after the Bulldogs shut out Mason County 26-0 in Maysville on Friday, Oct. 2. The win over Mason County allowed Short to... Read full article",
